        "f'(x) = xⁿ⁺¹/(n + 1)",
        "f'(x) = n · xⁿ",
        "f'(x) = (n − 1) · xⁿ"
      ],
      "info": "Potenzregel",
      "img": "⬇️🔢"
    },
    {
